---
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---
<dialog id="resource-modal" class="backpack" aria-label="资源背包"><div class="backpack-layout"><section class="reading-card" id="reading-card" hidden aria-labelledby="reading-title"><button class="backpack-close reading-close" type="button" aria-label="关闭背包，返回桌面">×</button><h2 id="reading-title"></h2><p id="reading-notice"></p><div id="reading-dates"></div><div id="reading-content"></div></section><div class="backpack-left"><section class="backpack-inventory" aria-label="选择资源"><button class="backpack-close" type="button" aria-label="关闭背包，返回桌面">×</button><div class="backpack-slots" id="backpack-slots"></div><p id="backpack-empty" hidden>这里还在整理，暂时没有公开资源。</p></section><section class="backpack-detail" aria-labelledby="backpack-title"><div class="backpack-detail-top"><h2 id="backpack-title"></h2><span id="backpack-kind"></span></div><p id="backpack-brief"></p><p id="backpack-note"></p><div id="backpack-actions"></div><img id="backpack-qr" hidden width="112" height="112" alt="发哥聊一聊AI 微信公众号二维码"><span class="sr-only" id="backpack-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></span></section></div><div class="backpack-keeper"><img id="backpack-actor" src={`${base}assets/fage-welcome.webp`} alt="发哥全身角色"></div></div></dialog>
